ns", "contents": [{"content": " \nPlan a vegan menu.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le07ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\tHello? <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tHi Vanessa. I've decided to do it. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tDo what? <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tWe were talking about the dangers of eating too much fat and sugar, and, as a result, I've decided to do a cleanse. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tThat's great Peter.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span> \tProblem is that I don't really know how. If I cut out all those things, what do I eat? I removed all the sugar, fat, meat and dairy from my kitchen with the result that there's nothing left except a few spices. If I had to live on what's in the fridge now, I would waste away to nothing. <br /><span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tWell, lucky for you, I'm a chef. Therefore, I can help you with some meals that you can throw together that don't have any of the ingredients that you are trying to avoid.  Long ago I worked in a vegan restaurant, resulting in the creation of lots of recipes that you can use. If there were more demand, I would open a small vegan restaurant. It's healthy and delicious if you make it right.", "time": "14000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter: </span>\t\tRecipes? You mean I can't just buy the food ready-made? If I could cook, I would open my own restaurant. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span> \tIt's not difficult. I'm going to e-mail you some recipes when I get home tonight. I'll send you some simple ones first. If I weren't so busy, I'd come and cook with you. A couple people are away this weekend and, as a result, I'm working all weekend.\n<span class=\"strong\">", "time": "57000", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn11le07ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter: </span> \t\tThat's okay. I'll have a look at them and see what I can do on my own. Maybe I'll ask Amy if she can help me. If I lost some weight, it would probably make her happy! She should support me in this! <br />\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa: </span>\t I'm sure she will. But don't forget \u2026 it's more about being healthy than getting thin.", "time": "80500", "id": 4}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}